        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Castellaneta, Deb Lacusta\n- Products: I Am Not Homer, Two Lips\n- Roles: television writer, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Deb Lacusta was born on March 15, 1958.\n- Deb Lacusta is an American television writer and actress.\n- Dan Castellaneta's album \"Two Lips\" was an all-music album released before \"I Am Not Homer.\"\n- \"I Am Not Homer\" is an album that collects comedy sketches written and performed by Dan Castellaneta and Deb Lacusta.\n- \"I Am Not Homer\" followed Dan Castellaneta's previous all-music album \"Two Lips.\"",
